# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model {#the-sherrington-kirkpatrick-model}"
msgstr "Ang Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model {#the-sherrington-kirkpatrick-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Sherrington-Kirkpatrick (SK) model is a foundational model in statistical mechanics, specifically within the study of spin glasses. Unlike the standard Ising model, where interactions are usually\n"
"limited to nearest neighbors, the SK model is an infinite-range model, meaning every spin interacts with every other spin in the system. This leads to a highly complex, \"rugged\", energy landscape characterized by\n"
"many local minima, which is the hallmark of glassy behavior.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Sherrington-Kirkpatrick (SK) model ay isang pundasyong modelo sa statistical mechanics, partikular sa pag-aaral ng spin glasses. Hindi tulad ng karaniwang Ising model, kung saan ang mga interaksyon ay karaniwang\n"
"limitado lamang sa pinakamalapit na kapitbahay, ang SK model ay isang infinite-range na modelo, ibig sabihin bawat spin ay nakikipag-ugnayan sa bawat ibang spin sa sistema. Nagreresulta ito sa isang lubhang kumplikado, \"magaspang\" (\"rugged\"), na energy landscape na nailalarawan ng\n"
"maraming local minima, na siyang katangian ng glassy na pag-uugali.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The core feature of the SK model lies in frustration. In the model, interaction strengths $J_ij$ between spins are randomly distributed between positive and negative values. This leads to situations (for\n"
"example, in triangular arrangements) where spins cannot be arranged to minimize all interactions simultaneously. In the SK model, because every spin interacts with every other spin, this frustration is compounded\n"
"globally, leading to a web of conflicting constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pangunahing katangian ng SK model ay nasa frustration. Sa modelo, ang mga interaction strengths na $J_ij$ sa pagitan ng mga spin ay random na ipinamamahagi sa pagitan ng positibo at negatibong mga halaga. Nagreresulta ito sa mga sitwasyon (halimbawa,\n"
"sa triangular na mga ayos) kung saan hindi maaaring ayusin ang mga spin upang mabawasan ang lahat ng interaksyon nang sabay-sabay. Sa SK model, dahil bawat spin ay nakikipag-ugnayan sa bawat ibang spin, ang frustration na ito ay lalong lumalala\n"
"sa buong sistema, na humahantong sa isang network ng nagkakasalungat na mga hadlang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mathematical formulation {#mathematical-formulation}"
msgstr "Pormulasyong matematikal {#mathematical-formulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state of the system is defined by a set of $N$ Ising spins, $s_i \\in \\{+1, -1 \\} $. The energy of a specific configuration is given by the Hamiltonian:\n"
msgstr "Ang estado ng sistema ay tinutukoy ng isang set ng $N$ na Ising spins, $s_i \\in \\{+1, -1 \\} $. Ang enerhiya ng isang partikular na configuration ay ibinibigay ng Hamiltonian:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$ H = - \\sum_{1 \\leq i \\leq j \\leq N} J_{ij} s_i s_j $$\n"
msgstr "$$ H = - \\sum_{1 \\leq i \\leq j \\leq N} J_{ij} s_i s_j $$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $J_{ij}$ is the coupling strength between spin $i$ and spin $j$.\n"
msgstr "kung saan ang $J_{ij}$ ay ang coupling strength sa pagitan ng spin $i$ at spin $j$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the SK model, the couplings $J_{ij}$ are independent and identically distributed random variables. To ensure that the energy remains extensive (proportional to $N$) as\n"
"$N \\rightarrow \\infty$, the variance of the couplings must scale with the number of particles:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa SK model, ang mga coupling na $J_{ij}$ ay independent at identically distributed random variables. Upang matiyak na ang enerhiya ay mananatiling extensive (proporsyonal sa $N$) habang\n"
"$N \\rightarrow \\infty$, dapat mag-scale ang variance ng mga coupling ayon sa bilang ng mga particle:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$ J_{ij} \\sim \\mathcal{N} \\left( 0, \\frac{J^2}{N} \\right)  $$\n"
msgstr "$$ J_{ij} \\sim \\mathcal{N} \\left( 0, \\frac{J^2}{N} \\right)  $$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ground state for a given $H$ is the specific configuration of spins ($s_1, s_2, ...s_n$), which minimizes the energy. Finding the ground state is an NP-hard optimization problem.\n"
msgstr "Ang ground state para sa isang ibinigay na $H$ ay ang partikular na configuration ng mga spin ($s_1, s_2, ...s_n$), na nagpapaliit sa enerhiya. Ang paghahanap ng ground state ay isang NP-hard na optimization problem.\n"

