#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Define the problem as an objective function {#step-1-define-the-problem-as-an-objective-function}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: Tukuyin ang problema bilang isang objective function {#step-1-define-the-problem-as-an-objective-function}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of obtaining the SK problem from a library as we do for the [Market Split problem](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), you formulate it directly.\n"
msgstr "Sa halip na kunin ang SK problem mula sa isang library gaya ng ginagawa natin para sa [Market Split problem](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), direkta mo itong bubuuin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `generate_sk_problem` function formulates the SK problem directly in the required dictionary format. The only input required is `n`, the number of spins in the model.\n"
msgstr "Bubuuin ng function na `generate_sk_problem` ang SK problem nang direkta sa kinakailangang dictionary format. Ang tanging input na kinakailangan ay ang `n`, ang bilang ng mga spin sa modelo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the function `_generate_couplings_sk_model` to calculate the random coupling terms in the SK model. For more control over the couplings, you can use optional arguments, which are explained in the function's docstring.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang function na `_generate_couplings_sk_model` upang kalkulahin ang random na coupling terms sa SK model. Para sa higit na kontrol sa mga coupling, maaari kang gumamit ng mga opsyonal na argumento, na ipinaliliwanag sa docstring ng function.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Solve the problem using the Parity Twine Optimizer {#step-2-solve-the-problem-using-the-parity-twine-optimizer}"
msgstr "Hakbang 2: Lutasin ang problema gamit ang Parity Twine Optimizer {#step-2-solve-the-problem-using-the-parity-twine-optimizer}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the functions above, you can set up the SK problem and a find solution by using the Twine Optimizer and a chosen IBM Quantum&reg; backend.\n"
msgstr "Gamit ang mga function sa itaas, maaari mong i-set up ang SK problem at maghanap ng solusyon gamit ang Twine Optimizer at isang piniling IBM Quantum&reg; backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To run the function, choose a suitable backend; for example, ibm_phoenix.\n"
msgstr "Upang patakbuhin ang function, pumili ng angkop na backend; halimbawa, ibm_phoenix.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optionally, use options for additional control over the submission:\n"
msgstr "Opsyonal, gumamit ng options para sa karagdagang kontrol sa submission:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where `shots` is an integer that specifies the number of circuit executions, `postprocessing_level` determines if post-processing is applied to the result,\n"
"`transpile_only` chooses if the problem is only transpiled to a circuit (and not solved), and `job_tags` is label to identify the job on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang `shots` ay isang integer na tumutukoy sa bilang ng circuit executions, ang `postprocessing_level` ay nagpapasiya kung ilalapat ang post-processing sa resulta,\n"
"ang `transpile_only` ay pumipili kung ang problema ay tine-transpile lamang sa isang circuit (at hindi nalulutas), at ang `job_tags` ay label na ginagamit upang tukuyin ang job sa IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The size of the SK model is defined by $N$, the number of interacting spins. Once you choose $N$, the code above generates the problem for `n_spins`.\n"
msgstr "Ang laki ng SK model ay tinutukoy ng $N$, ang bilang ng mga nakikipag-ugnayang spin. Kapag pinili mo na ang $N$, ang code sa itaas ay bubuo ng problema para sa `n_spins`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the optimizer:\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang optimizer:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the job status:\n"
msgstr "Suriin ang status ng job:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results:\n"
msgstr "Kunin ang mga resulta:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result is of form:\n"
msgstr "Ang resulta ay nasa form na:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the `solution` dictionary corresponds to the qubits defined in the problem and gives their optimized spin values for the SK model Hamiltonian.\n"
"This specific sequence of spins in the optimal solution represents the configuration that minimizes the total system energy based on the given random interaction strengths.\n"
"In the SK model, this can be regarded as the lowest energy state of a disordered magnetic system.\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang `solution` dictionary ay tumutugma sa mga qubit na tinukoy sa problema at nagbibigay ng kanilang na-optimize na spin values para sa Hamiltonian ng SK model.\n"
"Ang partikular na sunod-sunod na spin na ito sa optimal na solusyon ay kumakatawan sa configuration na nagpapaliit sa kabuuang enerhiya ng sistema batay sa ibinigay na random na interaction strengths.\n"
"Sa SK model, maituturing itong pinakamababang energy state ng isang disordered magnetic system.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`metadata` gives information on the transpilation (two qubit gates counts/depth, gates used, active qubits) and various runtimes.\n"
msgstr "Ang `metadata` ay nagbibigay ng impormasyon tungkol sa transpilation (two qubit gates counts/depth, mga gate na ginamit, aktibong qubits) at iba't ibang runtimes.\n"

